#: templates/config.html.twig:30
msgid ""
"Cleans emails imported by the mail collector before they become tickets or "
"follow-ups. Tickets and follow-ups created in GLPI, and later edits, are "
"never changed. If cleaning fails or would leave too little text, the "
"original email is kept."
msgstr ""
"Cleans emails imported by the mail collector before they become tickets or "
"follow-ups. Tickets and follow-ups created in GLPI, and later edits, are "
"never changed. If cleaning fails or would leave too little text, the "
"original email is kept."

